{"id": 1340, "title": "Fashion", "level": "Advanced", "hsk_tags": ["HSK5"], "slug": "fashion-story", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/1340_fashion-story.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["A：我喜欢这个发型,我要把头发染成粉色，烫卷，或许可以再剪短一点。你觉得呢？但是不知道发型师的手艺怎么样，我有点担心。", "B：粉色？虽说粉色挺好看的，可是很快就会过时。你的发质也会受到损伤，再说这种粉色很贵，你的储值卡还有钱吗？我觉得干练的发型就很适合你。不要总是追时髦。发型也得搭配自己的职业。", "A：别说了。萝卜青菜，各有所爱。我的梦想就是当个时尚达人,我不需要你做我的形象顾问。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["A：我喜歡這個髮型,我要把頭髮染成粉色，燙卷，或許可以再剪短一點。你覺得呢？但是不知道髮型師的手藝怎麼樣，我有點擔心。", "B：粉色？雖說粉色挺好看的，可是很快就會過時。你的髮質也會受到損傷，再說這種粉色很貴，你的儲值卡還有錢嗎？我覺得幹練的髮型就很適合你。不要總是追時髦。髮型也得搭配自己的職業。", "A：別說了。蘿蔔青菜，各有所愛。我的夢想就是當個時尚達人,我不需要你做我的形象顧問。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["A： wǒ xǐ huan zhè gè fà xíng , wǒ yào bǎ tóu fa rǎn chéng fěn sè， tàng juǎn， huò xǔ kě yǐ zài jiǎn duǎn yī diǎn。 nǐ jué de ne？ dàn shì bù zhī dào fà xíng shī de shǒu yì zěn me yàng， wǒ yǒu diǎn dān xīn。", "B： fěn sè？ suī shuō fěn sè tǐng hǎo kàn de， kě shì hěn kuài jiù huì guò shí。 nǐ de fà zhì yě huì shòu dào sǔn shāng， zài shuō zhè zhǒng fěn sè hěn guì， nǐ de chǔ zhí kǎ hái yǒu qián ma？ wǒ jué de gàn liàn de fà xíng jiù hěn shì hé nǐ。 bù yào zǒng shì zhuī shí máo。 fà xíng yě děi dā pèi zì jǐ de zhí yè。", "A： bié shuō le。 luó bo qīng cài， gè yǒu suǒ ài。 wǒ de mèng xiǎng jiù shì dāng gè shí shàng dá rén , wǒ bù xū yào nǐ zuò wǒ de xíng xiàng gù wèn。"], "english_paragraphs": ["A: I like this hairstyle. I want to dye my hair pink, curl it, and maybe cut it a little shorter. What do you think? But I don't know how good the hairstylist is, so I'm a little worried.", "B: Pink? It may look nice, but it'll go out of style quickly. It'll damage your hair, too. Besides, dyeing it that shade of pink is expensive. Do you have any money left on your prepaid card? I think a neat, professional hairstyle would suit you. Don't always chase the latest trends. Your hairstyle should fit your job, too.", "A: Enough. To each their own. My dream is to be a fashion icon, and I don't need you to be my image consultant."], "english_full": "A: I like this hairstyle. I want to dye my hair pink, curl it, and maybe cut it a little shorter. What do you think? But I don't know how good the hairstylist is, so I'm a little worried.\n\nB: Pink? It may look nice, but it'll go out of style quickly. It'll damage your hair, too. Besides, dyeing it that shade of pink is expensive. Do you have any money left on your prepaid card? I think a neat, professional hairstyle would suit you. Don't always chase the latest trends. Your hairstyle should fit your job, too.\n\nA: Enough. To each their own. My dream is to be a fashion icon, and I don't need you to be my image consultant.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">A</span><span class=\"tr\">A</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xǐ huan\" data-defn=\"to like; to be fond of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huan</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhè\" data-defn=\"this; these\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fà xíng\" data-defn=\"hairstyle; coiffure; hairdo\" data-hsk=\"HSK 7-9\"><span class=\"si\">发型</span><span class=\"tr\">髮型</span><rt>fà xíng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">,</span><span class=\"tr\">,</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yào\" data-defn=\"to want; to need; to ask for\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bǎ\" data-defn=\"(used to put the object before the verb: 把[ba3] + {noun} + {verb})\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">把</span><span class=\"tr\">把</span><rt>bǎ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tóu fa\" data-defn=\"hair (on the head)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">头发</span><span class=\"tr\">頭髮</span><rt>tóu fa</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rǎn\" data-defn=\"to dye / to catch (a disease) / to acquire (bad habits etc) / to contaminate / to add color washes to a painting\" data-hsk=\"HSK 6\"><span class=\"si\">染</span><span class=\"tr\">染</span><rt>rǎn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chéng\" data-defn=\"to succeed / to finish / to complete / to accomplish / to become / to turn into / to be all right\" data-hsk=\"HSK 6\"><span class=\"si\">成</span><span class=\"tr\">成</span><rt>chéng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fěn sè\" data-defn=\"pink / white / erotic / powdered (with make-up)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 6\"><span class=\"si\">粉色</span><span class=\"tr\">粉色</span><rt>fěn sè</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tàng\" data-defn=\"to scald / to burn (by scalding) / to blanch (cooking) / to heat (sth) up in hot water / to perm / to iron\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">烫</span><span class=\"tr\">燙</span><rt>tàng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"juǎn\" data-defn=\"a roll\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">卷</span><span class=\"tr\">卷</span><rt>juǎn</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"huò xǔ\" data-defn=\"perhaps; maybe\" data-hsk=\"HSK 6\"><span class=\"si\">或许</span><span class=\"tr\">或許</span><rt>huò xǔ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kě yǐ\" data-defn=\"can / may / possible / able to\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></r