o\" data-defn=\"to know; to become aware of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">知道</span><span class=\"tr\">知道</span><rt>zhī dào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fà xíng shī\" data-defn=\"hair stylist\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">发型师</span><span class=\"tr\">髮型師</span><rt>fà xíng shī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shǒu yì\" data-defn=\"craftmanship / workmanship / handicraft / trade\" data-hsk=\"HSK 6\"><span class=\"si\">手艺</span><span class=\"tr\">手藝</span><rt>shǒu yì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zěn me yàng\" data-defn=\"how? / how about? / how was it? / how are things?\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">怎么样</span><span class=\"tr\">怎麼樣</span><rt>zěn me yàng</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu diǎn\" data-defn=\"a little\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">有点</span><span class=\"tr\">有點</span><rt>yǒu diǎn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dān xīn\" data-defn=\"anxious / worried / uneasy\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">担心</span><span class=\"tr\">擔心</span><rt>dān xīn</rt></ruby>。", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">B</span><span class=\"tr\">B</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fěn sè\" data-defn=\"pink / white / erotic / powdered (with make-up)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 6\"><span class=\"si\">粉色</span><span class=\"tr\">粉色</span><rt>fěn sè</rt></ruby>？<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"suī shuō\" data-defn=\"though / although\" data-hsk=\"HSK 7-9\"><span class=\"s